**The system is NOT complete.** It is entirely in the planning phase. The architecture documentation is thorough and well-thought-out for an enterprise-grade platform, but there is no functional implementation of any component whatsoever.

**To make this a functional system, the entire codebase needs to be built from scratch** — starting with the foundation (package management, Docker setup, database schema, API gateway) and building upward through the microservices layer (product, listing, order, price, store, analytics, CRM services) and outward through marketplace integrations (eBay, Amazon, Facebook, Etsy, Shopify adapters).